WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.147 --> 00:00:05.370
"I have to get to Trends Department Store," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:09.236
"Mannequins came to life!"

3
00:00:09.237 --> 00:00:11.072
She went back to her friends.

4
00:00:11.073 --> 00:00:15.020
"I'll be right back. I'm going to get a drink of water."

5
00:00:15.021 --> 00:00:16.834
Roxy ran off.

6
00:00:16.835 --> 00:00:19.371
"Good luck!" Terrell called.

7
00:00:19.372 --> 00:00:24.828
Mara raised an eyebrow. "What does Roxy need good luck for?"

8
00:00:24.829 --> 00:00:28.712
"Oh, um . . . " Terrell bit his lip.

9
00:00:28.713 --> 00:00:34.363
"Maybe she'll have a hard time finding a water fountain."

10
00:00:34.364 --> 00:00:37.742
Roxy arrived outside Trends Department Store.

11
00:00:37.743 --> 00:00:40.329
Several people were hiding outside.

12
00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:43.273
They looked scared.

13
00:00:43.274 --> 00:00:46.031
"Rocket Girl!" a woman said.

14
00:00:46.032 --> 00:00:50.670
"I'm glad you're here. Mannequins are coming to life!"

15
00:00:50.671 --> 00:00:53.871
"I know." Roxy looked around.

16
00:00:53.872 --> 00:00:55.939
"Where are the mannequins?"

17
00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:58.526
"I don't know," a man said.

18
00:00:58.527 --> 00:01:02.822
"But they tried to make us wear ugly clothes!"

19
00:01:02.823 --> 00:01:09.420
"We fought them off," another woman said.

20
00:01:09.421 --> 00:01:12.199
Roxy found Detective Smith inside.

21
00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:18.220
He was standing in a clothing section.

22
00:01:18.221 --> 00:01:21.500
"Good! You're here," the detective said.

23
00:01:21.501 --> 00:01:24.677
"Ahh!" Roxy pretended to be scared.

24
00:01:24.678 --> 00:01:28.254
"That mannequin just talked!"

25
00:01:28.255 --> 00:01:30.306
Detective Smith frowned.

26
00:01:30.307 --> 00:01:33.753
"I'm not a mannequin, Rocket Girl."

27
00:01:33.754 --> 00:01:39.003
Roxy rolled her eyes. "I know that, Detective."

28
00:01:39.004 --> 00:01:40.859
She looked around.

29
00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:45.618
"Are the mannequins in here? Some people outside saw them."

30
00:01:45.619 --> 00:01:49.768
"I think the mannequins are gone," Detective Smith said.

31
00:01:49.769 --> 00:01:52.914
A woman peeked out from under a clothing rack.

32
00:01:52.915 --> 00:01:55.357
"Are they really gone?"

33
00:01:55.358 --> 00:01:57.102
Detective Smith jumped.

34
00:01:57.103 --> 00:02:02.406
"Oh! You scared me! Yes, they're gone."

35
00:02:02.407 --> 00:02:07.175
"Whew!" The woman crawled out from under the rack.

36
00:02:07.176 --> 00:02:11.904
She dusted herself off. "I was so scared!"

37
00:02:11.905 --> 00:02:14.805
"What happened here?" Roxy asked.

38
00:02:14.806 --> 00:02:17.673
The woman took a deep breath.

39
00:02:17.674 --> 00:02:20.909
"I was dressing mannequins in some new clothes.

40
00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:24.081
Suddenly they came to life.

41
00:02:24.082 --> 00:02:27.288
They tried to make me wear the clothes too.

42
00:02:27.289 --> 00:02:29.197
I refused.

43
00:02:29.198 --> 00:02:32.899
The clothes were too ugly."

44
00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:37.414
"What clothes are the mannequins wearing?" Detective Smith asked.

45
00:02:37.415 --> 00:02:40.413
The woman pointed to a rack of ugly clothes.

46
00:02:40.414 --> 00:02:44.584
"It's a new line of clothing."

47
00:02:44.585 --> 00:02:49.660
Roxy read a label. "'Viktor Velour'?"

48
00:02:49.661 --> 00:02:53.172
The woman nodded. "He's the designer.

49
00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:59.119
These clothes are all from his new line. They're absolutely horrible."

50
00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:03.268
She snorted. "I read an interview with Viktor.

51
00:03:03.269 --> 00:03:06.371
He said that everyone in the world will wear his clothes.

52
00:03:06.372 --> 00:03:13.639
I seriously doubt it! Nobody with good taste would wear them."

53
00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:16.830
Detective Smith pulled a scarf off the rack.

54
00:03:16.831 --> 00:03:18.609
It had wavy stripes.

55
00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:23.763
"I kind of like this." The detective put the scarf on.

56
00:03:23.764 --> 00:03:27.558
Suddenly his eyes went blank.

57
00:03:27.559 --> 00:03:36.798
"I look fabulous! From now on, I will only wear Viktor Velour's clothes!"

